      "description": "Native selected state around fixed reference content.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-candidate\"><button class=\"ds-area\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-letter\">B</span><strong>Sir John Everett Millais Building East</strong><span class=\"ds-value\">92.0 <small>/100</small></span><span>7 min walk</span></button></article>",
